  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "comment": "Mycoplasma was cultured in modified pleuropneumonia-like organism (PPLO) medium supplemented with 20% inactivated horse serum (Hyclone, Logan, WV, USA), 10% yeast extract, thallium acetate (0.125 mg/ml) and penicillin (200 IU/ml)."
